UPDATE companies SET description='Founded in 1981 in Van Buren, Arkansas, Franklin Food Equipment has spent over four decades serving commercial kitchens across northwestern Arkansas and eastern Oklahoma. The company began as a service-focused operation, providing factory-trained repair, maintenance, and installation for major brands of commercial cooking, food processing, and refrigeration equipment.

Today, the company offers a full range of services for both hot-side and cold-side equipment. Technicians handle gas and electric ovens, fryers, grills, charbroilers, steam cookers, walk-in coolers and freezers, refrigerated display cases, ice machines, mixers, dough rollers, slicers, meat processing equipment, and dishwashers. In addition to on-site repair, Franklin Food Equipment rebuilds mixers, dough rollers, meat processing equipment, and dish machines, often at a fraction of replacement cost. The company maintains a large inventory of OEM parts and sells new and used equipment from brands such as Hobart, Berkel, Vulcan, and Traulsen, backed by factory-trained installation. Preventative maintenance plans are also available to reduce emergency breakdowns.

The client base spans restaurants, commercial bakeries, food preparation operations, grocery stores, meat processors, schools, medical and nursing facilities, and correctional facilities. Service calls are dispatched within a roughly 200-mile radius of Fort Smith, covering communities including Van Buren, Fort Smith, Russellville, Conway, Waldron, and Mena in Arkansas, as well as Talihina, Wilburton, Stigler, and Poteau in eastern Oklahoma.

Franklin Food Equipment differentiates itself through its factory-trained technicians, extensive parts inventory, and rapid on-site response. The company emphasizes equipment rebuilding as a cost-saving alternative to replacement and offers preventative maintenance programs designed to extend equipment life and minimize downtime during peak hours.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Commercial refrigeration repair", "Commercial cooking equipment repair", "Prep & dish equipment repair", "Equipment rebuilding", "Preventative maintenance plans", "New equipment sales", "Used equipment sales", "Factory-trained installation", "Parts sales", "Walk-in cooler repair", "Freezer repair", "Ice machine repair", "Gas oven repair", "Electric oven repair", "Fryer repair", "Grill repair", "Charbroiler repair", "Steam cooking equipment repair", "Mixer repair", "Dough roller repair", "Slicer repair", "Meat processing equipment repair", "Dishwasher repair"], "industries": ["Restaurants", "Commercial bakeries", "Food prep operations", "Grocery stores", "Meat processors", "Schools", "Medical & nursing facilities", "Correctional facilities"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["Berkel", "Frijado", "Hobart", "Baxter", "Scotsman", "Traulsen", "Vulcan", "Doyon", "Hobart 84145 Food Cutter", "Hobart HL200 20 Quart Mixer", "Hobart HL662 60 Quart Mixer", "Hobart A200 Mixer", "Acme Dough Roller"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Factory-trained technicians for most major brands", "Large OEM parts inventory on hand", "Equipment rebuilding at a fraction of replacement cost", "Preventative maintenance plans to reduce emergency calls", "200-mile on-site service radius across two states"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1981 -> db", "Headquarters Van Buren, Arkansas -> db", "Services: repair, maintenance, installation, sales -> /", "Industries served: restaurants, commercial bakeries, food prep operations, grocery stores, meat processors, schools, medical 