UPDATE companies SET description='Fremont Automotive, Inc. operates from Selinsgrove, Pennsylvania, and has been serving the automotive aftermarket for over 24 years. The company maintains four locations across central Pennsylvania, including Mount Pleasant Mills, Lewisburg, Millerstown, and its headquarters in Selinsgrove.

