UPDATE companies SET description='The company provides vertically integrated services from concept and product development through high-volume production. Freudenberg Medical runs 12 manufacturing sites and two sales offices across key MedTech hubs, encompassing over 813,000 square feet of manufacturing space and employing more than 2,700 people globally.

The company serves medical device and biopharma customers exclusively, supporting projects ranging from minimally invasive catheters and steerable shafts to implantable, wearable, and interventional devices. Recent expansions — such as a cleanroom sterilization service (CleanAssure) for ready-to-use biopharma assemblies and a Costa Rica site for high-volume thermoplastic extrusion — illustrate its focus on nearshoring and sterile supply-chain solutions.

Freudenberg Medical differentiates itself by combining deep clinical insight with materials expertise across silicones, thermoplastics, metals, and coatings. Its strategic acquisitions — including Fuji Seiko for precision metal tubing, APEC for thermoplastic molding, MedVenture for catheter manufacturing, and a joint venture with VistaMed in Ireland — have broadened its ability to deliver complex, finished devices from a single source.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 13485','ISO 14001']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Hydrophilic coating application", "Drug coating application", "Scientific injection molding", "Thermoplastic extrusion", "Silicone molding", "Silicone extrusion", "Catheter development and manufacturing", "Complex catheter design and assembly", "Precision metal tubing manufacturing", "Hypotube manufacturing", "Specialty needle manufacturing", "Metal machining and fabrication", "Advanced surface finishing for metals", "Controlled cleaning and sterilization (ISO Class 5 cleanroom)", "Concept and product development", "Rapid prototyping", "High-volume production", "Vertically integrated CDMO services"], "industries": ["Medical devices", "Pharmaceuticals", "Biotechnology", "Minimally invasive devices", "Implantable medical devices", "Wearable medical devices", "Interventional medical devices"], "materials": ["Silicones", "Thermoplastics", "Metals (tubing, hypotubes, needles)", "Hydrophilic coating materials", "Drug coating materials"], "equipment": [], "volume": "Prototype to high-volume production", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Vertically integrated CDMO from concept through commercialization", "Global footprint of 12 manufacturing sites and 2 sales offices in major MedTech hubs", "Deep materials expertise spanning silicones, thermoplastics, metals, and coatings", "ISO Class 5 controlled cleanroom for sterile single-use assemblies (CleanAssure)", "Proprietary hydrophilic coating technology (LUBRITEQ) integrating chemistry and device e