UPDATE companies SET description='Friesen''s Inc was founded in 1939 in Detroit Lakes, Minnesota. The company has been designing and delivering customized engineering solutions for food processors since its inception, building a reputation on innovative equipment solutions for manufacturing and materials handling plant environments.

The company provides custom engineered processing systems, including conveyors, hydraulic power units, control panels, and belting. Its fabrication capabilities were recently expanded with a state-of-the-art fiber laser center with nitrogen generation, satin finish processes, and passivation bays. An in-house team of engineers, programmers, and production professionals handles design, fabrication, parts manufacturing, and service. The UL-listed IP69K-rated panel shop produces custom control systems.

Friesen''s serves the food processing, packaging, and manufacturing industries, with additional belting solutions for agriculture, canning, printing, and package handling. Named customers include Kraft Foods, KLN Enterprise, Monogram Food Solutions (Monogram Meats Snacks), Plumrose USA, and Brown Packing. The equipment is designed for hygienic, wash-down environments and meets food safety and employee safety standards.

The company emphasizes in-house engineering as its backbone, with engineers acting as expert system integrators. Differentiators include 24/7/365 nationwide service and support, factory acceptance testing (virtual or in-person), passivation treatment for hygienic delivery, and the ability to design curved incline conveyors. The focus on attention to detail, food safety, functionality, and hygienic design is cited as the foundation of their approach.', certifications=ARRAY['UL listed IP69K']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom engineering and design", "System controls programming", "Hydraulic system design and repair", "Lightweight belting fabrication", "Parts manufacturing and supply", "Passivation treatment", "Factory acceptance testing (FAT)", "Custom conveyor design (including curved incline)", "Stainless steel fabrication", "Laser cutting with nitrogen generation", "Satin finishing", "Panel shop (UL listed IP69K)", "Custom hydraulic power unit design", "Field service for belting", "Custom-built parts and specialty parts", "Sanitary/hygienic equipment design"], "industries": ["Food Processing", "Packaging", "Manufacturing", "Agriculture", "Canning", "Printing", "Package handling"], "materials": ["Stainless steel"], "equipment": ["Fiber laser center with nitrogen generation", "Passivation bays", "UL listed IP69K rated panel shop", "Satin finish processes"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["24/7/365 nationwide service and support", "In-house engineering team as expert system integrators", "State-of-the-art fiber laser center with nitrogen generation", "UL-listed IP69K-rated panel shop for custom controls", "Passivation treatment to ensure hygienic delivery", "Virtual and in-person factory acceptance testing", "Custom curved incline conveyor design capability"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1939 in Detroit Lakes, Minnesota -> db", "Provides design, fabrication, parts, service solutions for food processing, packaging, manufacturing ->