UPDATE companies SET description='Front Range Renewable Energy (FRRE) operates from Deming, New Mexico, where it moved its headquarters to the Sunrise RV Park on East Pine Street. The company does not disclose its founding year or ownership structure, but it presents itself as a dedicated provider of off-grid energy solutions.

FRRE designs, builds, and sells a range of portable solar power equipment under its own branding. Its product line includes the Mini Too and Mini Portable Solar Power Station generators, solar suitcases in 60‑watt and 100‑watt configurations, RV and camper solar systems, the All American Sun Oven, a 12‑volt 5‑watt battery maintainer, and the Bilge Buddy solar pump. The company also offers complete off‑grid system installation and home energy audits.

Its home energy audit service targets residential customers seeking to reduce electricity costs, while its educational materials aim at broader community awareness. FRRE positions itself as a one‑stop shop for both product supply and implementation.

FRRE emphasizes that its portable generators are fully customizable and upgradeable to adapt to changing power needs. It also highlights a commitment to consumer education, stating that proper knowledge enables energy‑conscious purchases and lifestyle changes. The firm’s stated mission is to advance the renewable energy industry through both product development and community outreach.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Off-grid solar product design and assembly", "Portable solar generator customization", "Solar system installation", "Home energy audits", "Renewable energy education"], "industries": ["Renewable energy", "Off-grid power", "Recreational vehicles", "Marine", "Residential energy efficiency", "Fleet management"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Fully customizable and upgradeable portable solar generators", "Fleet pricing available", "Specialized in off-grid energy products and installation", "Home energy audit services", "Community education on energy savings"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters in Deming, NM at Sunrise RV Park -> /", "Product line includes Mini Too, Mini Portable Solar Power Station, solar suitcases (60W, 100W), RV/camper systems, All American Sun Oven, 12V 5W charger, Bilge Buddy -> /", "Off-grid energy products and installation services -> /", "Home energy audit service -> /", "Fleet pricing available -> /", "Portable generators fully customizable and upgradeable -> /", "Commitment to renewable energy industry development and community education -> db", "Solar suitcases designed and built with top quality components -> db", "Company dedicated to highest level of service and commitment -> db", "Education focus: energy saving video, 50% electric bill reduction claim -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Both solar suitcases are designed and built with top quality components", "founded_year": "", "employee_co