UPDATE companies SET description='Frugll was founded in 2017 in Salt Lake City, Utah, by co-founders Jordan Folsom and Josh Giddings. The company began with a mission to help homeowners maximize solar savings through a direct-to-consumer approach that eliminates sales commissions and marketing overhead.

