UPDATE companies SET description='GLW, formerly Great Lakes Woodworking, was founded in 1984 in Detroit, Michigan, when carpenters Mike Mancinelli and Paul LaCroix left their separate jobs to start a business together in a garage. Eventual owner Tony Gatliff later joined to help expand the operation. The partners built the company on enduring relationships and a commitment to craftsmanship, keeping production in Detroit as they grew.

The company design-engineers, manufactures, and installs custom fixtures and commercial environments. Its capabilities span woodworking (solid wood and veneer), glass integration with in-house UV welding, metal finishing and plating, acrylic and plexiglass fabrication, stone (marble, quartz, granite) incorporation, plastic laminate pressing, and upholstery and leatherwork. GLW serves retailers, hospitality venues, corporate offices, athletic facilities, and museums nationwide, delivering projects from storefronts and modular display systems to museum display cases.

GLW’s customer base includes prestigious retailers across the country, with projects ranging from retail fixture rollouts and custom entryways to corporate office interiors and locker rooms. The firm emphasizes value engineering and design flexibility, often developing custom tooling and processes for each job to meet precise standards.

The founders’ original vision centered on engineering as a differentiator—Paul LaCroix noted that engineering “was going to set us apart,” while Tony Gatliff cites product quality and owners who deeply care about their work as hallmarks. GLW positions itself as a partner that streamlines manufacturing and installation, offering fixtures engineered for easy setup and creative solutions to complex spatial problems.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom woodworking (solid wood, live edge)", "Wood veneer fabrication", "Glass UV welding (in-house)", "Metal finishing and plating (brushed, etched, paint, powder coating)", "Acrylic and plexiglass fabrication", "Stone integration (marble, quartz, granite)", "Plastic laminate pressing (in-house)", "Upholstery and leatherwork", "Design engineering", "Installation services", "Retail fixture rollouts", "Custom entryway and door fabrication", "Museum display case fabrication", "Custom millwork and cabinetry"], "industries": ["Retail", "Hospitality", "Corporate Office", "Athletic Facilities", "Museums", "Commercial Construction"], "materials": ["Solid wood", "Wood veneer", "Glass", "Metal", "Acrylic", "Plexiglass", "Marble", "Quartz", "Granite", "Plastic laminate", "Upholstery fabric", "Leather"], "equipment": ["Plastic laminate presses", "UV welding equipment"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Design-engineered, delivered, and installed fixtures without hassle", "Creative solutions to complex problems through old-world craftsmanship and design engineering", "Value engineering and design flexibility with cost-saving alternatives", "Ability to engineer and deliver from a napkin sketch", "Fixtures engineered for easy installation and streamlined setup"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1984 by Mike Mancinelli and Paul LaCroix -> /about-us", "Eventual owner Tony Gatliff helped expand -> /about-us", "Started in a garage in Detroit, Michigan -> /about-us", "Over 40 years in business -> /", "Design-engineers, manufactures, and installs custom fixtures and commercial environments -> /about-us", "Capabilities: woodworking, veneer, glass UV welding, metal finishing, acrylic/plexiglass, stone, plastic laminate pressing, upholstery/leatherwork -> /capabilities", "In-house plastic laminate presses -> /capabilities", "In-house UV welding for glass -> /capabilities", "Industries served: retail, hospitality, corporate office, athletic facilities, museums -> /", "Services: retail fixture rollouts, custom entryways, museum displays, custom wood products -> /", "Differentiators: fixtures without headaches, creative solutions, value engineering, vision from napkin sketch, engineered for easy install -> /", "Headquarters: Detroit, MI -> db", "Company name GLW, formerly Great Lakes Woodworking -> /about-us"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "GLW specializes in manufacturing high-end custom wood products for commercial projects requiring consistent quality and engineering support.", "founded_year": "1984", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='glw' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
