UPDATE companies SET description='Gateway Plastics Inc, operating as Silgan Specialty Packaging, is headquartered in Mequon, Wisconsin. The business traces its roots to 1970 as a division of Silgan Holdings Inc., a global leader in rigid packaging solutions.

