UPDATE companies SET description='Global Foods, headquartered in Las Vegas, Nevada, was founded in 1996 as a national food distribution company. The company distributes food and related goods across the United States and strategically sources products globally through long-standing manufacturer partnerships. No founders or ownership details are disclosed.

