UPDATE companies SET description='Gold Medal Products Co. – Indianapolis operates from Noblesville, Indiana, where it has served as the region’s concession equipment and supplies provider since 1993. The branch is managed by Michael Knotts and functions as a local sales and support outpost for the broader Gold Medal Products Co. network.

